screens.prose:
The obvious code scans ahead from every day:

```python
for i in range(n):
    for j in range(i + 1, n):
        if xs[j] > xs[i]:
            ans[i] = xs[j]
            break
```

In a falling market no later close is ever higher, so no scan stops early.

widget.solution:
def next_greater(xs):
    ans = [-1] * len(xs)
    stack = []  # indices still waiting
    for i, x in enumerate(xs):
        while stack and xs[stack[-1]] < x:
            ans[stack.pop()] = x
        stack.append(i)
    return ans

def days_until_higher(prices):
    ans = [0] * len(prices)
    stack = []  # indices of days still waiting
    for i, p in enumerate(prices):
        while stack and prices[stack[-1]] < p:
            j = stack.pop()
            ans[j] = i - j
        stack.append(i)
    return ans
